ubcc0\ud658]256PUTTZZLE_RAW_IMAGE_8.png", "id": "1174988316468342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982474_1174988319801675_5356656402935387114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YNjWLZ8HnnMQ7kNvwF_in8n&_nc_oc=Adoz50WFt63GedE54nLftE3iXQqcTknxpFGp7AQCFHZsOFSEwnJqrvuIxVKPba4Ej-U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKZvHf_fA7iq1NHq3B28hacDPk-cYWViwlX35_gbEirjA&oe=6AAFE85C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "\ucea1\ucc98_2022_10_28_17_08_12_390.png", "id": "665571025131462", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75222944_665571028464795_3967012109877024291_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E2AAUC0bCMwQ7kNvwGfykNS&_nc_oc=Adpy6GjnrUdRwXAkzFc87vJ8myPRL9llQe5kWJWlEIbNKkMDwKzd38fuhk5Lls3Roic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLnACKs3TlW5wqoYzXyczEb-Fe1Wr1KjYJnMrXk15vIFA&oe=6AAFFE2A"}, "display_name": "PUTTZZLE", "keywords": [], "long_description": "You have only one objective in this game:  Putt your ball into the hole. \nIn order to do so, you will be given two items in this game: a hammer and a heavy ball.\n\nJust putt the ball into the hole to complete each stage. \n-Try to avoid various terrain and obstacles.\n-Try using any method to complete the stage with the number of given opportunities.\n \n[Intuitive controls]\nPUTTZZLE is simple. Just putt the ball into the hole by any means. \n\n[Entertainment from simplicity]\nJust focus on putting the ball into the target.\nCalculate the number of cases to solve each stage. \n\n[Increasing difficulty level]\n[PUTTZLE] is like a puzzle. You will experience more complicated stages as you finish each stage with even more obstacles. \nYou can even utilize obstacles or avoid them to finish the stage.", "short_description": "PUTT YOUR BALL IN IT! "}]}, "developer_name": "Pixelity Gamelab", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://pixelitygames.com/privacy-poli